<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#333;">
  <h2>We received your order</h2>
  <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
  <p>Thanks for your order. We have received it and will process it shortly.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Order ID:</strong> {{order_id}}</li>
